    "html": "<p>A car of mass <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"m\"></span> is traveling along a horizontal road at constant speed. The total resistive force acting on the car is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"F\"></span> and the power of the car’s engine is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"P\"></span>. What is the speed of the car?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"mP\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"FP\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{P}{m}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{P}{F}\"></span></li>\n</ol>"
